,blocks:[]},{id:6,slug:aF,title:aG,title_seo:"Bursa Berjangka Komoditi & Derivatif | ICDX",description_seo:"ICDX hadir sebagai bursa berjangka & infrastruktur pasar terintegrasi yang menjadikan Indonesia sebagai pusat perdagangan global untuk berbagai komoditas termasuk Aset Digital, Pertambangan, Energi, dan Valuta Asing.",active:b,name:a,url:a,component:a,published:b,parent_slug:aF,subMenus:a,cover_default:{square:[],landscape:[]},blocks:[]},{id:8,slug:aH,title:aI,title_seo:"Tentang Indonesia Commodity & Derivatives Exchange 2021",description_seo:"ICDX merupakan sarana di mana pembeli dan penjual bertransaksi. ICDX menyediakan tempat bertransaksi yang aman, terkendali, dan terpantau, serta memberikan tempat bagi mereka yang ingin mengambil keuntungan dengan memanfaatkan risiko. ICDX juga menyediakan pasar yang efisien dan transparan bagi komoditas di Indonesia.",active:b,name:a,url:aH,component:a,published:b,parent_slug:a,subMenus:[{title:"Company Profile",slug:"\u002Fabout-us\u002Fcompany-profile"},{title:"Visual Identity",slug:"\u002Fabout-us\u002Fvisual-identity"}],cover_default:{square:[],landscape:[]},blocks:[{id:203033,type:g,model:"App\\Models\\Aboutus",cover_default:{desktop:[]},cover_mobile_default:{mobile:[]},background_default:{desktop:[]},icon_button_default:{desktop:[]},blocks:[]}]}]},slug:v,modal:{search:p,user:p},gofx:{pialang:{}},notification:{data:{active:p,message:a,color:"bg-green-300"}},seo:{title:r,desc:r,image:a},url:{params:{},query:{}},user:{profile:{},isSignedIn:p,fetch:void 0},i18n:{routeParams:{}},route:{name:"membership-slug___en",path:w,hash:a,query:{},params:{slug:L},fullPath:w,meta:{},from:{name:h,path:aJ,hash:a,query:{},params:{},fullPath:aJ,meta:{}}}},serverRendered:true,routePath:w,config:{},__i18n:{langs:{en:{home:aG,yes:"Yes",no:"No",login:"Login",logout:"Logout",back:"Back",formError:"You cannot update to the database",formSuccess:"Succes to save the database",needLogin:"You need to login to see this feature",send:"SEND",register:"Daftar",tryDemo:"Coba Demo",readMore:"Read More",seeDetail:"See Details",learnMore:aK,viewJob:"View Job",seeOurMember:"See Our Members",weeklyReport:"Weekly Report",typeHere:"Type here…",join:"Join",fullQuota:"Full Quota",homeDailyReport:"Daily",homeWeeklyReport:"Weekly",homeMonthlyReport:"Members",allVideo:"All Video",seeAll:"SEE ALL",seeGofxPrice:"SEE GOFX PRICE",memberOf:"Member of",regulated:"Licensed and supervised by",certified:"Certified by",seeCpotrPrice:"SEE CPOTR PRICE",seeOtcPrice:"SEE OTC PRICE",license:"License",officialPrices:"OFFICIAL PRICES",cpotrPrices:"CPOTR\u003Cbr\u003EPRICES",homeGOFXDesc:"GOFX is our spearheading initiative to bring, for the first time in Indonesia, fairly-priced exchange-traded, regulated contracts in gold, crude oil and forex to the public at large, including in easily-traded micro version.",homeGOFXButton:"Find Out More ",homeCarbonTitle:"Historical Price",homeCarbonCalculatorTitle:"Carbon Calculator",corpNewsTitle:aA,corpNewsDesc:"Stay updated with the latest developments and key initiatives from our company.",homeCarbonDesc:"Get our historical price data to enrich your market analysis.",homeCarbonDesc2:"Indonesia Climate Exchange (ICX) is the nations engine to support the commitment to reach carbon neutrality and to restore the earth one trade at a time.",homeCarbonCalculator:"Our tool provides a free-to-use calculation to keep track of the carbon footprint emitted by individuals and organizations.",homeAcademyButton:aK,homeAcademyButton1:"Join Our Class",homeAcademyButton2:"Learn More Materials",homeAcademyButton3:"Join Our Community",homeCarbonButton:"Find Out More",homeAboutUsTitle:aI,homeAboutUsDesc:"Get to know us more",homeMemberTitle:"Be Our Member",homeMemberDesc:"We always prioritize the best service for our members and strive to help them reach their best potential.",homeAbout:ay,homeAboutDesc:"Learn with ICDX",homeMember:"\u003Cspan class=\"text-orange\"\u003EICDX\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E MEMBERS",homeAboutICDX:"\u003Cspan class=\"text-orange\"\u003EIndonesia Commodity & Derivatives Exchange \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E (ICDX)",homeDescICDXButton:"See More ",homeDescHide:"Hide ",tradingView:"\u003Cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003EThe chart we use is provided by TradingView, a charting platform for traders and investors from all around the world. The tools and data available are highly beneficial for enhancing the potential of the website and financial platform as a whole. Take a look at various price insights for\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003E stocks\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003E, bonds, forex, and other financial instruments in an easily understandable format. In addition to charts, TradingView also offers various features such as an\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ca style=\"text-decoration: none\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tradingview.com\u002Feconomic-calendar\u002F\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: #E07131\"\u003E Economic Calendar\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003E,\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003E Stock Screener\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003E, and more.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",homeDescICDX1:"\u003Ch2 class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(58, 186, 192)\"\u003EAbout ICDX\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\u003Cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003EICDX is a futures exchange that provides a marketplace for commodities and their derivatives trade, both in physical form and financial products, and is integrated with a clearing institution (Indonesia Clearing House) and a logistic center (ICDX Logistik Berikat). ICDX provides services in the form of facilities and infrastructure for....\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",homeDescICDX2:"\u003Ch2 class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(58, 186, 192)\"\u003EAbout ICDX\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\u003Cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003EICDX is a futures exchange that provides a marketplace for commodities and their derivatives trade, both in physical form and financial products, and is integrated with a clearing institution (Indonesia Clearing House) and a logistic center (ICDX Logistik Berikat). ICDX provides services in the form of facilities and infrastructure for futures market participants, including traders, futures brokers, and customers. The ICDX futures exchange is regulated directly by the Commodity Futures Trading Supervisory Agency (CoFTRA) under the Indonesian Ministry of Trade.\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102)\"\u003E\u003Cbr \u002F\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Ch2 class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(58, 186, 192)\"\u003EICDX Products \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\u003Cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003ECommodities traded in ICDX include tin, palm oil, gold, crude oil, \u003Ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.icdx.co.id\u002Fnews-detail\u002Fpublication\u002Fsyariah-definisi-prinsip-dan-praktik-ekonomi-syariah\"\u003E\u003Cu\u003Esyariah\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fa\u003E commodity and forex. Currently, \u003Ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.icdx.co.id\u002Four-market\u002Fsharia\"\u003E\u003Cu\u003Esharia\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fa\u003E commodity transactions on the ICDX commodity exchange serve liquidity needs for Islamic financial institutions and financing facilities for their customers. One of ICDX’ products that is suitable for beginner investors is GOFX (Gold, Oil, Forex). GOFX is an exchange-traded product, which consists of a collection of spot and futures contracts. GOFX has two contract sizes which are smaller than the standard futures and spot contracts, namely mini (1\u002F10 of a standard contract) and micro (1\u002F100 of a standard contract). Beginners in trading can take advantage of GOFX Micro which supports a smaller trading capital than GOFX Mini. \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Ch2 class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(58, 186, 192)\"\u003ETrading on an Exchange \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\u003Cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003EAn exchange trading system allows many sellers and many buyers to make transactions without having to disclose each other’s personal information (many to many). The system then allows sellers and buyers to perform price discovery and obtain prices according to the supply (price offered by the seller) and demand (the price desired by the buyer) in the market. \u003C\u002Fp\u003E",memberDesc:"Tentang Perusahaan",memberTitle:"Nama Perusahaan",memberMemberCode:"Kode Perusahaan",memberLicenseBappebti:"No. Izin BAPPEBTI",memberLicenseICDX:"No. Keanggotaaan ICDX",memberLicenseICH:"No. keanggotaan ICH",memberLicenseActivity:" Activity License",memberAddress:"Alamat",memberPhoneNumber:"No. Telepon",memberEmail:C,memberAccountNumber:"No. rekening segregated account",memberWebsite:"Website",memberUpcomingEvent:"Upcoming Event",memberArticleHelpful:"Do you find the article helpful?",complianceTrainingTitle:"Have any requests for training? Send us your request!",bappebti:"Coftra regulation",academyClassTypeName:"Choose Type of Class",academyClassTypePlaceHolder:"Choose Here",academyCommunityTitle:"Welcome to Our Community!",academyCommunityDesc:"This page is an open forum for anyone to start a conversation about trading futures and trading commodities.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EYou will find a blue tick symbol which means the account has been verified. So, through this page, you can find answers from verified profiles, from members to our partners.",academyCommunityButton:"ASK A question",academyNeedLogin:"You need to log in to see this feature ",academyNeedLoginWith:"Log in with",footerContactUs:aq,footerAddress:"Midpoint Place, 22nd Floor, K.H. Fachrudin Street No. 26, Tanah Abang, Jakarta Pusat",footerAddress2:"Jl. M.H. Thamrin No.3 7th Floor, RT.11\u002FRW.2, Gambir, Central Jakarta City, Jakarta 10110",gofxBannerFormText1:"TERIMA KASIH TELAH MENDAFTAR\u003Cbr\u003EAKUN DEMO GOFX",gofxBannerFormText2:"Cek email Anda",gofxBannerFormText3:"Kami mengirimkan username dan password akun demo GOFX melalui email Anda (cek di inbox atau spam email peserta). Jangan lupa untuk menjaga kerahasiaan username dan password Anda.",gofxBannerFormText4:"Anda juga dapat mengunduh platform trading GOFX melalui link download yang kami kirimkan melalui email Anda.",gofxBannerFormName:"Nama Lengkap",gofxBannerFormPhoneNumber:aL,gofxBannerFormEmail:C,gofxFormName:"Nama Lengkap Sesuai KTP",gofxFormPhoneNumber:aL,gofxFormEmail:C,gofxFormPialang:"Pilih Pialang",gofxFormJadwal:"Pilih Jadwal",gofxFormYes:"Ya",gofxFormNo:"Tidak",gofxFormTNC1:"Apakah Anda sudah pernah trading?",gofxFormTNC2:"Apakah Anda bersedia dihubungi pihak bursa\u002Fpialang \u003Cb\u003Euntuk proses pembukaan akun?\u003C\u002Fb\u003E",gofxFormTNC3:"Perhatian! Peserta \u003Cb\u003Eharus di atas 21 tahun \u003C\u002Fb\u003E dan akan diminta untuk melakukan investasi sejumlah \u003Cb\u003E*Rp500.000,-\u003C\u002Fb\u003E yang akan dikonversikan ke dalam akun trading GOFX mikro",gofxFormText1:"Terima kasih sudah mendaftar!\u003Cbr \u002F\u003ECek email Anda",webinarText:"Terima kasih sudah mendaftar!",webinarText2:"Berikut link zoom untuk mengikuti webinar : ",gofxFormText2:"Untuk menyelesaikan registrasi ke tahap berikutnya. Informasi lebih lanjut silahkan menghubungi pialang yang Anda pilih pada saat mengisi formulir pendaftaran.",todaysTradeProduct:z,jobName:"Name",jobNameDesc:"Insert your full name",jobMessage:"Message ",jobMessageDesc:"Tell us something about you…",jobAttachment:"Attachments",jobAttachmentDesc:"Attach your CV and other required documents max. 10 MB",jobLink:"Link",jobLinkDesc:"Drop your digital profile or port